WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.380
Need a better way to handle signing agreements and routing sealed PDFs in Google Docs, without handing your data to another monthly cloud landlord?

2
00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:19.370
Watch SignRoute in action: Draw a smooth, high-DPI signature with your mouse, trackpad, or stylus right inside the Google Docs sidebar and save it for one-click reuse.

3
